189	    /**
190	     * The owner's member id, formatted {@code '<REGION><FY><HASH8><CHK>'} with no separators: the
191	     * region code baked from the postcode at creation, the two-digit fiscal year of the
192	     * business-day-adjusted registration date, the eight upper-hex {@code HASH8} (the first eight hex
193	     * characters of the SHA-256 digest of the normalized telephone followed by the last name, the same
194	     * segment used by the region-and-hash identity), and a single Luhn check digit {@code CHK} computed
195	     * over the digits of {@code <REGION><FY><HASH8>} (e.g. {@code 'NSW261A2B3C4D7'}). Assigned at
196	     * creation time; if the computed value collides with an existing owner's member id it is
197	     * de-duplicated by appending {@code '-<n>'}. This single value unifies the former customer code and
198	     * membership number.
199	     */
